<para>This class is meant to be subclassed, see <simplesect kind="see"><para>QGenericDefinition for more informations, and <ref refid="PlatoOmegaInterface_8h_1a710bfdc0d0cd024d668d218549e7a835" kindref="member">added</ref> to <ref refid="xomp__accelerator__sched__test__v2_8c_1a3ae7250ea1c766616dca7aaf4f657c14" kindref="member">a</ref> <ref refid="classQLanguageFactory" kindref="compound">QLanguageFactory</ref>.</para></simplesect>
<ref refid="classA" kindref="compound">A</ref> language definition is a wrapper that creates interfaces for a given file extension from internally handled data (XML files in the case of QGenericDefinition)</para><para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classQLanguageFactory" kindref="compound">QLanguageFactory</ref> </para></simplesect>
</para>    </detaileddescription>
